{"v":3,"catch":"動畫系統視覺小說『Devil Girl』","desc":"角色使用了E-mote動畫系統。\n呼吸、眨眼、說話，栩栩如生。\n並且，收錄了日語配音。\n\n在轉校後的新學校裡，遇見了破天荒的學生會長！\n制定獨自的學園法，並把學園私有化的首魁——亨國閖那。\n原以為她是個暴君，沒想到卻被學生們仰慕著……？\n後來，因為意外的事情我被她看中，參加了學生會。\n在被她牽著鼻子走的日子裡，她的秘密被揭開了——","publisher":"moesoft","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["冒險","模擬","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 1.1GB / Switch 1.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a7a7d3304c6d9da55bb1037d4a033ac4a872632833e37ebd399d4fcdab126cfe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bb81397021d26649d00d655c16da86cfff8e4e38a3099bb5d12f0ea2692787c6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7d2eb185602596ac04dbb48e9a3a94ca83ca93d7bd0334393eb39a9611cb17dd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/31418d849497bbf983ce35bea4538f9019741742676c2f849388b0b01a739fe0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7100acdbe3fbea25b8f577488d1502333d62cd7d35330e59845d06f2747886df.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/11a4f37f536c3d795f8676f625ce238d131958a2039f861ab951fbb1f25c00f0.jpg"],"titleId":"010030701f114000","dlc":[]}